            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>There is provided a system for measuring chlorophyll fluorescence. The system comprises at least one light source configured to emit substantially collimated or convergently focussed light so as to irradiate an area with light; an actuator configured to controllably direct the light from the light source so as to enable the light source to irradiate a plurality of different areas with light; and an optical sensor configured to detect chlorophyll fluorescence from each area irradiated with light.</p>
            </abstract>
